e beautiful, glowing art installations throughout the game world.\nThese installations can take the form of intricate patterns, flowing designs, or even abstract masterpieces\u2014all designed to evoke a sense of peace and serenity.", "short_description": "\"Thug Taggering\" is a captivating VR game designed to immerse players in a tranquil yet engaging environment. Set in a serene virtual world filled with lush landscapes, calming music, and picturesque scenery, the game offers a unique experience of relaxation and creativity."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/thugtaggering2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zenix & Raider", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/thugtaggering", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "7723376171078758"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639798_456084440373208_1341647878683428954_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_92XNLxaSwQQ7kNvwHDZTcM&_nc_oc=AdpbWYuM2kOd_pbic17Hms1SqqWDz2wRLTpHV79s_AjKL7EbQH_sgIvlQMNgY4F8kS8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyuOvVbvqwDgRNTILGXabqqc862je7QFofX3IHhZjO3Kw&oe=69D0EF15"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Thug T